\par 
\par What is the difference between closing and exiting?
\par }{\b\f0\insrsid15349339\charrsid15349339 Close}{\b\f0\insrsid15349339 
\par       }{\f0\insrsid15349339 It is only document close but not the software e.g. Microsoft word, excel...etc.
\par }{\b\f0\insrsid15349339 Exit
\par  }{\f0\insrsid15349339    When we press exit it close the whole document, excel...Etc along with software}{\f0\insrsid15349339\charrsid15349339 
\par }{\insrsid13913427 
