\par }{\insrsid13913427 What is slide transition? What is the method of adding a transition in }{\insrsid125 PowerPoint}{\insrsid13913427  slides?\tab 
\par }{\insrsid125 
\par It is the most important part of presentation. Because of Transition we don\rquote t need to click with mouse to go to the next slide.
\par  
\par Transition, 
\par           When we need to give a presentation, we can select the auto time on it. The different between the slides it could be 10 seconds. When we go to animation and there we can find transition.
