\par }{\insrsid13913427 How we can modify column widths and row heights?
\par }{\insrsid125 
\par }{\b\insrsid125 Column Widths
\par      }{\insrsid125     Select the column and right click from the mouse there is a option of column width click on it and it ll show you the current width of the column }{\insrsid10951221 you put your require width in it. Same ways for one columns or all.
}{\insrsid125 
\par }{\insrsid10951221 Row height,
\par          Select the number of rows you want to change the height right click at the border area of the rows there is a option of change row height. Click on it, it ll show you the current height of the rows 
there you can put the require height of the row you need.
\par    
\par }{\insrsid10951221\charrsid125 
